{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/bef747a48a2a8d43c4841e12c89f2de2502a672e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on a circle of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are situated so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/dae6bc753ebba9c994174574426cc84f12af201d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=AC, AB&gt;r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"148\" height=\"16\" />, and the length of minor arc <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. If angles are measured in radians, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/0/170b19af2418102c6ed44ec750f2a579e6322380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB/BC=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cad0445f8a3e2981969ac6b261c962573da90c76.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw(Circle((0,0), 13)); draw((-13,0)--(12,5)--(12,-5)--cycle); dot((-13,0)); dot((12,5)); dot((12,-5)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (-13,0), W); label(&quot;B&quot;, (12,5), NE); label(&quot;C&quot;, (12,-5), SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77c68b294ace6dde2a4ea6239172ce32c1dffddc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\csc{\\frac{1}{4}} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\cos{\\frac{1}{2}} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4\\sin{\\frac{1}{2}} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\csc{\\frac{1}{2}} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2\\sec{\\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"555\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First note that arc length equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/38329fc03996c582569d1f64d2b1becf87d2135d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r\\theta$\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the central angle in radians. Call the center of the circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/8/af8958c21237c08826be92874510434d8457594e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{BOC} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"14\" /> radian because the minor arc <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is isosceles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/e/46e7498c9af21f6b9f222b32d232cffb2af864b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{AOB} = \\pi - \\tfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"122\" height=\"21\" />. We use the Law of Cosines to find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbcb4203f52f3c00815b2294805a86befd30722f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AB}{BC} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2r^2 - 2r^2\\cos{(\\pi - \\frac{1}{2})}}}{\\sqrt{2r^2 - 2r^2\\cos1}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{1 + \\cos{(\\frac{1}{2})}}}{\\sqrt{1 - \\cos1}}.\\]\" width=\"371\" height=\"56\" /> \nUsing half-angle formulas, we have that this ratio simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/1/361770ab7ba9346bf073a184266fa6b6de91c77b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\cos\\frac{1}{4}}{\\sin{\\frac{1}{2}}} = \\frac{\\cos\\frac{1}{4}}{\\sqrt{1 - \\cos^2{\\frac{1}{2}}}} = \\frac{\\cos\\frac{1}{4}}{\\sqrt{(1 + \\cos{\\frac{1}{2}})(1 - \\cos{\\frac{1}{2}})}} = \\frac{\\cos{\\frac{1}{4}}}{2\\cos{\\frac{1}{4}}\\sin{\\frac{1}{4}}}\\]\" width=\"491\" height=\"59\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/0/390164fc95f13b9a5e2dfa40658e0c71b95a5ce3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\boxed{\\frac{1}{2}\\csc{\\frac{1}{4}}.}\\]\" width=\"90\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/8/d9821ba68087361a4d9e446f4b88232bd5dd2799.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw(Circle((0,0), 13)); draw((-13,0)--(12,5)--(12,-5)--cycle); dot((-13,0)); dot((12,5)); dot((12,-5)); dot((12,0)); dot((0,0)); draw((-13,0)--(12,0)--cycle); label(&quot;A&quot;, (-13,0), W); label(&quot;B&quot;, (12,5), NE); label(&quot;C&quot;, (12,-5), SE); label(&quot;D&quot;, (12,0), NW); label(&quot;O&quot;, (0,0), NE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" />\n</p><p>Let the center of this circle be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/c/d3c5d25f5f1b3c66d71390dbdd9f326a4c7ce769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BOC = \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"14\" />, the radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c748db2ab4a67c0aa0dace8827ba7cbc3a48aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\odot O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>By the definition of radian, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/8/cb87d95d66bdc875f01eed7f7ab01915cadb1d06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta =$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f997f2e439fbb9578ac4d715bc866bbea93ebc2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overarc{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/9/dc99484633fd6cae005da353fc3a82b1b6994df9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$/r=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/5/725b00616209c8fe6e399572b68a4fbd8c2c7d26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC=\\frac{\\angle BOC}{2} = \\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/a/b6a6a0e5c80dff9f239fe0c3c5b1671a116bcd26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\angle BAD = \\frac{BD}{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"142\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/3/d435666d9d0fae92a2112319ce349eec34deed41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\frac{\\angle BAC}{2} = \\frac{\\frac{BC}{2}}{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"143\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/b/b8b1c73af9ed5b3d7db2d11e6d6f4919c98edcc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{BC}{AB}=2 \\sin \\frac{\\frac12}{2} = 2\\sin \\frac14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"186\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/797a84750db778aa0e580883dbec4effc2fe9598.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AB}{BC}= \\frac{1}{2\\sin \\frac14} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } \\frac{1}{2} \\csc \\frac{1}{4} }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"238\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t